OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge failed sex assault
OL,4,Avictim 'at every stage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was sexually assaulted by a
OL,7,Fman given a key to her hotel room was
OL,8,F"fundamentally failed" by Travelodge
OL,9,F"at every stage", an independent review
OL,10,Fhas found.
OL,12,FBarrister Paul Greaney KC said the
OL,13,Fchain's security policies at the time
OL,14,Fof the attack at its Maidenhead hotel
OL,15,Fin December 2022 were "not fit for the
OL,16,Fpurpose of keeping guests safe".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
