OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge failed sex assault
OL,4,Avictim 'at every stage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe found guests were still not as safe
OL,7,Fas they should be, with room intrusions
OL,8,Freported at nearly one in 10 Travelodge
OL,9,Fhotels this summer, and no policy in
OL,10,Fplace on violence against women and
OL,11,Fgirls.
OL,13,FTravelodge apologised "unreservedly" to
OL,14,Fthe woman. The review did credit the
OL,15,Fcompany with making changes since
OL,16,FMarch.
